#. module: hr_attendance_holidays_kiosk
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:hr_attendance_holidays_kiosk.edit_holiday_status_form_kiosk
msgid ""
"Kiosk reasons should normally not require an allocation, otherwise\n"
"                        the time off generated at check-out is skipped when the employee\n"
"                        has no valid allocation."
msgstr ""
"Dôvody pre kiosk by spravidla nemali vyžadovať nárok, inak sa voľno\n"
"                        vytvorené pri odchode vynechá, ak zamestnanec nemá platný nárok."

