#. module: hr_attendance_holidays_kiosk
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_attendance_holidays_kiosk.field_hr_leave_type__kiosk_visible
msgid ""
"Offer this reason when an employee checks out at the attendance kiosk.\n"
"Kiosk reason types should normally not require an allocation, otherwise the generated time off is skipped when the employee has no allocation."
msgstr ""
"Ponúknuť tento dôvod, keď sa zamestnanec odhlasuje na kiosku dochádzky.\n"
"Typy voľna pre kiosk by spravidla nemali vyžadovať nárok, inak sa vytvorené voľno vynechá, ak zamestnanec nemá nárok."

#. module: hr_attendance_holidays_kiosk
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_attendance_holidays_kiosk.field_hr_leave_type__kiosk_sequence
msgid "Order of the reason buttons on the kiosk check-out screen."
msgstr "Poradie tlačidiel s dôvodmi na obrazovke odchodu na kiosku."

