#. module: hr_attendance_holidays_kiosk
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:hr_attendance_holidays_kiosk.action_kiosk_leave_reasons
msgid ""
"These Time Off Types appear as buttons when employees check out at the\n"
"                attendance kiosk. Drag the handle to change their order, and set a colour\n"
"                to tell them apart on the touchscreen."
msgstr ""
"Tieto typy voľných dní sa zobrazia ako tlačidlá, keď sa zamestnanci odhlasujú\n"
"                na kiosku dochádzky. Poradie zmeníte potiahnutím úchytu a farbou ich\n"
"                rozlíšite na dotykovej obrazovke."

#. module: hr_attendance_holidays_kiosk
#: model:ir.model,name:hr_attendance_holidays_kiosk.model_hr_leave_type
